    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "When you slide the window, the step is not the chunk size — it's the size minus the overlap. That one subtraction is what makes chunks overlap instead of gapping.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.52,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02",
        "at": "2026-09-11T15:59:59"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "A fixed splitter cuts mid-word at four hundred characters. Recursive splitting tries paragraphs, then lines, then sentences — it stops at a real boundary.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.43,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03",
        "at": "2026-09-11T15:59:59"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Same size and overlap, but recursive made ten chunks where fixed made eight — because it won't pack text up to the limit. Chunk size is a ceiling, not a target.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.77,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B04",
        "at": "2026-09-11T15:59:59"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "LIST",
      "narration_text": "The real distribution is bimodal — short headers and fragments, tall body paragraphs. Minimum sixty-seven, max three eighty-eight, median a hundred and four.",
      "shot": {
